<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Portofolio Denis, Junior Network Engineer — siswa kelas X TJKT.">
  <title>Denis | Junior Network Engineer</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #08111f;
      --panel: #101d30;
      --panel-2: #13243a;
      --text: #edf5ff;
      --muted: #9aadc4;
      --accent: #35d6c5;
      --accent-2: #66a8ff;
      --line: rgba(160,190,220,.16);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 8%, rgba(53,214,197,.12), transparent 25rem),
        radial-gradient(circle at 5% 35%, rgba(102,168,255,.10), transparent 28rem),
        var(--bg);
      color: var(--text); line-height: 1.65;
    }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    .container { width: min(1080px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin: auto; }
    header { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10; backdrop-filter: blur(16px); background: rgba(8,17,31,.78); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    nav { min-height: 72px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }
    .brand { font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .brand span { color: var(--accent); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 26px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .92rem; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    .hero { min-height: 650px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; align-items: center; gap: 55px; padding: 90px 0 80px; }
    .eyebrow { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; color: var(--accent); border: 1px solid rgba(53,214,197,.25); background: rgba(53,214,197,.07); padding: 7px 13px; border-radius: 99px; font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 650; }
    .dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--accent); }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 8vw, 5.8rem); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.065em; margin: 24px 0 18px; }
    h1 span { color: var(--accent); }
    .hero p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 590px; font-size: 1.08rem; }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 13px; margin-top: 32px; }
    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 12px 19px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-size: .92rem; transition: .2s; }
    .btn-primary { color: #06131c; background: var(--accent); }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(53,214,197,.2); }
    .btn-outline { border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--text); }
    .btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
    .network-card { position: relative; min-height: 350px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 24px; background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(19,36,58,.95), rgba(12,25,42,.8)); display: grid; place-items: center; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 25px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.25); }
    .network-card::before, .network-card::after { content: ""; position: absolute; border: 1px solid rgba(102,168,255,.15); border-radius: 50%; width: 260px; height: 260px; }
    .network-card::after { width: 360px; height: 360px; }
    .network-art { position: relative; width: 260px; height: 240px; z-index: 1; }
    .node { position: absolute; width: 58px; height: 58px; border-radius: 16px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #162d47; border: 1px solid rgba(53,214,197,.45); color: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(53,214,197,.1); font-size: 1.45rem; }
    .node.main { width: 78px; height: 78px; left: 91px; top: 81px; border-radius: 22px; background: rgba(53,214,197,.13); font-size: 1.9rem; }
    .n1 { left: 0; top: 0; } .n2 { right: 0; top: 0; } .n3 { left: 0; bottom: 0; } .n4 { right: 0; bottom: 0; }
    .wire { position: absolute; height: 2px; width: 115px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--accent-2), var(--accent)); transform-origin: left; opacity: .8; }
    .w1 { left: 43px; top: 48px; transform: rotate(38deg); } .w2 { left: 144px; top: 113px; transform: rotate(-38deg); }
    .w3 { left: 43px; top: 190px; transform: rotate(-38deg); } .w4 { left: 144px; top: 127px; transform: rotate(38deg); }
    section { padding: 78px 0; }
    .section-label { color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .16em; font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 800; }
    h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); letter-spacing: -.04em; margin: 8px 0 28px; }
    .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; }
    .card { background: rgba(16,29,48,.78); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; padding: 27px; }
    .card p { color: var(--muted); }
    .facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; }
    .fact { padding: 17px; border-radius: 13px; background: var(--panel-2); }
    .fact small { display: block; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .fact strong { font-size: .98rem; }
    .skills { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 17px; }
    .skill { padding: 23px; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; }
    .skill-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .skill h3 { margin-bottom: 7px; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .skill p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .91rem; }
    .projects { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
    .project-tag { display: inline-block; color: var(--accent); background: rgba(53,214,197,.08); border-radius: 6px; padding: 4px 9px; font-size: .75rem; margin-bottom: 13px; }
    .project h3 { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .project p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .94rem; }
    .note { margin-top: 17px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; }
    .contact-box { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 25px; padding: 34px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid rgba(53,214,197,.25); background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(53,214,197,.10), rgba(102,168,255,.08)); }
    .contact-box p { color: var(--muted); }
    footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 25px 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .86rem; text-align: center; }
    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .nav-links { gap: 13px; font-size: .82rem; }
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 70px; gap: 35px; }
      .network-card { min-height: 300px; }
      .about-grid, .skills, .projects { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .contact-box { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 430px) {
      .container { width: min(100% - 28px, 1080px); }
      nav { min-height: 64px; } .nav-links { gap: 10px; } .nav-links a { font-size: .75rem; }
      .facts { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <nav class="container">
      <a class="brand" href="#beranda">DENIS<span>.</span></a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#tentang">Tentang</a>
        <a href="#keahlian">Keahlian</a>
        <a href="#proyek">Proyek</a>
        <a href="#kontak">Kontak</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="container hero" id="beranda">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> JUNIOR NETWORK ENGINEER</div>
        <h1>Halo, saya<br><span>Denis.</span></h1>
        <p>Siswa kelas X jurusan Teknik Jaringan Komputer dan Telekomunikasi (TJKT) yang tertarik mempelajari dunia jaringan komputer, infrastruktur jaringan, dan teknologi komunikasi.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#proyek">Lihat Portofolio ↗</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#kontak">Hubungi Saya</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="network-card" aria-label="Ilustrasi topologi jaringan komputer">
        <div class="network-art">
          <div class="wire w1"></div><div class="wire w2"></div><div class="wire w3"></div><div class="wire w4"></div>
          <div class="node n1">⌘</div><div class="node n2">⌁</div><div class="node n3">▤</div><div class="node n4">◉</div>
          <div class="node main">⌘</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container" id="tentang">
      <div class="section-label">01 / Tentang Saya</div>
      <h2>Mengenal lebih dekat.</h2>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <p>Saya adalah pelajar yang sedang membangun dasar pengetahuan dan keterampilan di bidang jaringan komputer. Saya senang mengeksplorasi cara perangkat saling terhubung, memahami konfigurasi jaringan, serta belajar menyelesaikan masalah teknis secara terstruktur.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:14px">Saya terus mengembangkan kemampuan melalui pembelajaran di sekolah dan latihan praktik agar siap berkembang menjadi network engineer yang kompeten.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card facts">
          <div class="fact"><small>Nama</small><strong>Denis</strong></div>
          <div class="fact"><small>Kelas</small><strong>X - TJKT</strong></div>
          <div class="fact"><small>Jurusan</small><strong>Teknik Jaringan Komputer dan Telekomunikasi</strong></div>
          <div class="fact"><small>Fokus</small><strong>Networking & Infrastruktur</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container" id="keahlian">
      <div class="section-label">02 / Keahlian</div>
      <h2>Bidang yang saya pelajari.</h2>
      <div class="skills">
        <article class="skill"><div class="skill-icon">🌐</div><h3>Dasar Jaringan</h3><p>Memahami konsep LAN, WAN, topologi jaringan, serta fungsi perangkat jaringan.</p></article>
        <article class="skill"><div class="skill-icon">🔌</div><h3>Perangkat & Kabel</h3><p>Mengenal router, switch, access point, kabel UTP, dan konektor jaringan.</p></article>
        <article class="skill"><div class="skill-icon">🛠️</div><h3>Troubleshooting</h3><p>Belajar mengidentifikasi gangguan koneksi dan melakukan pemeriksaan dasar jaringan.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container" id="proyek">
      <div class="section-label">03 / Proyek Pembelajaran</div>
      <h2>Latihan dan eksplorasi.</h2>
      <div class="projects">
        <article class="card project">
          <span class="project-tag">NETWORK FUNDAMENTAL</span>
          <h3>Mengenal Topologi Jaringan</h3>
          <p>Mempelajari bentuk topologi seperti star, bus, dan ring beserta karakteristik serta penggunaannya.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card project">
          <span class="project-tag">NETWORK CABLING</span>
          <h3>Pengenalan Kabel UTP</h3>
          <p>Mempelajari jenis kabel jaringan, urutan warna kabel straight dan crossover, serta fungsi konektor RJ45.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="note">Catatan: bagian proyek dapat diperbarui dengan dokumentasi praktik, foto kegiatan, dan hasil konfigurasi yang benar-benar pernah dikerjakan.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="container" id="kontak">
      <div class="contact-box">
        <div>
          <div class="section-label">04 / Kontak</div>
          <h2 style="margin-bottom:7px">Mari terhubung.</h2>
          <p>Terbuka untuk belajar, berbagi pengetahuan, dan berdiskusi seputar teknologi jaringan.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:emailkamu@example.com">Kirim Email ↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">© 2026 Denis · Junior Network Engineer Portfolio</div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
